{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is approached, grab it and process it. Then, if an obstacle is detected, avoid it. Finally, take a task and perform it.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    />",
